WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.122 --> 00:00:18.007
Bajie took a step back as a dark mist surrounded the people on the road.

2
00:00:20.248 --> 00:00:25.810
When the mist cleared, he saw they were really a monster and several little demons.

3
00:00:26.971 --> 00:00:28.251
The monster grinned at him.

4
00:00:30.536 --> 00:00:32.517
you here for the feast, Pig.

5
00:00:33.737 --> 00:00:36.078
We're going to eat you for lunch!"

6
00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:43.381
"What?" Bajie raised his rake and swung as the monster approached.

7
00:00:45.082 --> 00:00:47.663
The demons rushed toward the pig from all sides.

8
00:00:47.683 --> 00:00:51.345
"That rotten monkey lied to me!"

9
00:00:51.645 --> 00:00:52.425
cried Bajie.

10
00:00:53.546 --> 00:00:56.827
He spun around and knocked over two demons with his rake.

11
00:00:57.747 --> 00:00:58.868
monster threw a punch.

12
00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.393
Bajie blocked the punch with his rake.

13
00:01:03.274 --> 00:01:05.795
"Ow!" cried the monster, rubbing his hand.

14
00:01:07.175 --> 00:01:09.717
Bajie kicked a demon sneaking up behind him.

15
00:01:09.737 --> 00:01:14.059
"That monkey is always causing problems!"

16
00:01:14.319 --> 00:01:15.059
the pig muttered.

17
00:01:16.019 --> 00:01:18.420
He slammed the rake down on another demon.

18
00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:21.082
what if I like to eat?

19
00:01:21.642 --> 00:01:23.163
Did he really have to trick me?"

20
00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:25.924
The monster attacked again.

21
00:01:26.496 --> 00:01:30.717
Bajie thrust his rake toward him, still complaining about Wukong.

22
00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:35.378
"Wukong is small—he doesn't need to eat as much as I do!"

23
00:01:36.419 --> 00:01:40.680
The monster suddenly stopped fighting and looked at Bajie curiously.

24
00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.001
"You just said 'Wukong.'

25
00:01:45.061 --> 00:01:51.683
Are you talking about Sun Wukong, the monkey who defeated Heaven's entire army five hundred years ago?"

26
00:01:51.703 --> 00:01:56.060
"Um, yes," said Bajie.

27
00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:56.860
"Do you know him?"

28
00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.923
"I've heard he's traveling with the Tang Monk," said the monster.

29
00:02:02.863 --> 00:02:05.764
"You must be traveling with the Tang Monk too."

30
00:02:07.265 --> 00:02:09.226
"Why are you interested in the monk?"

31
00:02:09.626 --> 00:02:11.286
asked Bajie suspiciously.

32
00:02:12.127 --> 00:02:13.607
The monster licked his lips.

33
00:02:14.668 --> 00:02:19.070
"I've heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever."

34
00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:24.352
Panicked, Bajie ran from the demons and back to his companions.

35
00:02:26.068 --> 00:02:27.089
pointed at Wukong.

36
00:02:27.109 --> 00:02:28.410
"You tricked me!"

37
00:02:29.671 --> 00:02:30.852
monkey was laughing.

38
00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:33.735
"How was the feast, Bajie?"

39
00:02:36.137 --> 00:02:38.118
Bajie's eyes burned with fury.

40
00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.841
He turned to the Tang Monk.

41
00:02:41.982 --> 00:02:44.043
"Wukong told me there was a feast up ahead.

42
00:02:44.924 --> 00:02:47.146
instead it was a group of demons and a monster.

43
00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.108
They tried to eat me!"

44
00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:51.790
The Tang Monk was angry.

45
00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:56.017
"Bajie, I thought you were going to check the mountain!

46
00:02:56.978 --> 00:02:58.839
Instead you went to look for a feast?

47
00:03:00.119 --> 00:03:00.820
lied to me.

48
00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.841
You should be ashamed of yourself!"

49
00:03:04.642 --> 00:03:05.422
hung his head.

50
00:03:06.243 --> 00:03:09.344
By now Wukong was rolling on the ground, laughing.

51
00:03:09.404 --> 00:03:12.666
"And you, Wukong," snapped the Tang Monk.

52
00:03:12.686 --> 00:03:16.228
"I should recite the Tight Headband spell to punish you!"

53
00:03:17.789 --> 00:03:19.270
the monkey stopped laughing.

54
00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.971
He jumped to his feet.

55
00:03:22.411 --> 00:03:23.552
"Please don't do that!"

56
00:03:24.712 --> 00:03:27.894
"You knew there were demons and a monster ahead," said the monk.

57
00:03:27.914 --> 00:03:29.896
"And you didn't say anything?"

58
00:03:31.837 --> 00:03:32.457
shook his head.

59
00:03:32.477 --> 00:03:34.719
"You should have said something, Wukong."

60
00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.223
"I admit I knew about the demons and the monster," said Wukong.

61
00:03:40.243 --> 00:03:42.724
"But they're not dangerous."

62
00:03:42.744 --> 00:03:45.466
"Not dangerous?"

63
00:03:45.726 --> 00:03:46.727
Bajie scoffed.

64
00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:48.508
wanted to eat me!

65
00:03:49.249 --> 00:03:51.130
And now they're planning to eat Master!"

66
00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.631
"Oh no!"

67
00:03:52.931 --> 00:03:53.872
cried the Tang Monk.

68
00:03:55.548 --> 00:03:56.548
held up his hands.

69
00:03:56.568 --> 00:03:58.749
"Relax, Master.

70
00:03:59.609 --> 00:04:01.610
You have nothing to worry about."

71
00:04:05.931 --> 00:04:10.332
"We must capture the Tang Monk," the monster said to the demons.

72
00:04:11.653 --> 00:04:12.933
we need a plan.

73
00:04:13.513 --> 00:04:15.134
Sun Wukong is strong.

74
00:04:16.154 --> 00:04:19.735
Did you know that he once defeated Heaven's entire army?"

75
00:04:19.755 --> 00:04:23.896
"Yes, we've heard," said one of the demons.

76
00:04:25.496 --> 00:04:26.597
demon hurried over.

77
00:04:26.617 --> 00:04:29.259
"I just spied on the travelers.

78
00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:38.566
The Tang Monk has three spirit companions—Sun Wukong, that pig, and a purple fellow."

79
00:04:38.586 --> 00:04:41.588
"Hmm," said the monster.

80
00:04:41.608 --> 00:04:42.688
"That's bad."

81
00:04:42.709 --> 00:04:46.291
"Not really," said the demon.

82
00:04:46.311 --> 00:04:50.494
"I have a plan to lure the spirits away from the monk."

83
00:04:51.335 --> 00:04:53.076
The demon told the monster his plan.

84
00:04:54.252 --> 00:04:57.237
he was done speaking, the demon folded his arms.

85
00:04:57.257 --> 00:04:58.879
"What do you think?"

86
00:05:00.341 --> 00:05:03.145
big smile spread across the monster's face.

87
00:05:03.165 --> 00:05:05.308
"I love
